        <mxCell id="flow_text" value="1. Analyst → Orchestrator (Agentforce, 12 topics)  →  2. CRM: company_lookup (IR_Company__c SOQL)  →  3. CRM: coverage_check (IR_Coverage__c SOQL)&#xa;4. MCP: SEC EDGAR get_10k (real SEC filings via Lambda)  →  5. MCP: Market Data get_quote (real Alpha Vantage via Lambda)&#xa;6. A2A: Financial Analysis Agent (Strands @tool: DCF + comps + Monte Carlo + Bedrock narrative)&#xa;7. A2A: Sentiment Analysis Agent (Strands @tool: Comprehend NLP + Bedrock synthesis)&#xa;8. Compliance Agent (separate Agentforce agent: restricted list + trading window + MNPI)  →  9. Orchestrator assembles IR_Research_Note__c&#xa;10. Returns brief to analyst  →  11. Langfuse: full trace with spans across both platforms  →  12. IR_Audit_Log__c: compliance record in CRM" style="text;fontSize=9;fontColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
